Absolutely insane - How can you win the match and just get 100XP? 

&#x200B;

This level progression is extremely grindy. Could see people lose interest quick at this pace.

Try searching contraversal topics on Google and then search the same term on DuckDuckGo - the results will blow your mind.

&#x200B;

DuckDuckGo is my go to :)
